@startuml editor-deployment
title Editor - Despliegue y procesos
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

node "Equipo del disenador" as workstation {
  node "Proceso Electron" as electron {
    component "Main process\nmain.js + ipc/" as main
    component "Preload isolated\npreload.js" as preload
    component "Renderer\nAngular build" as renderer
  }
  folder "Carpeta del editor\nDocumentos/HoneyComb\n(o la elegida)" as project
  folder "Datos de Electron\nhoneycomb-settings.json\nrecuperacion/" as settings
  folder "Instalacion\nschema/, editor/, engine/" as install
  node "Toolchain del motor" as toolchain {
    component "CMake + Ninja" as cmake
    component "MSYS2 UCRT64 (g++)" as gcc
    component "vcpkg\nraylib, SDL2, nlohmann-json" as vcpkg
  }
  node "Procesos del motor" as engines {
    component "engine/build/engine.exe\nDebug (F3, F1, F2...)" as debugExe
    component "engine/build-release/engine.exe\nRelease (-O3)" as releaseExe
  }
  folder "Juego exportado\n<Juego>/ y <Juego>.zip" as exported
}

node "Entorno de desarrollo" as dev {
  component "Angular dev server\nng serve :4200" as ng
  component "Node.js / npm" as node
}

component "HoneyComb-Setup.cmd\nasistente de instalacion" as setup
component "HoneyComb.cmd\n(editor compilado)\neditor.cmd\n(dev server)" as launchers

setup --> toolchain : instala lo que falte
setup --> install : compila motor y editor
launchers --> electron : abre el editor
node --> ng : npm run dev
ng --> renderer : ELECTRON_START_URL
main --> preload
preload --> renderer
renderer --> project : IPC y filesystem
main --> settings : carpeta elegida,\ncopia sin guardar
main --> install : catalogo de eventos,\nschema del nivel
main --> cmake : compilar Debug / Release
cmake --> gcc
cmake --> vcpkg
cmake --> engines
main --> engines : Ejecutar (nivel absoluto,\n--portada)
project --> engines : levels, assets, game.json
main --> exported : Exportar juego\n(copia el Release)

note bottom
Desarrollo: Electron carga Angular desde localhost si esta disponible.
Instalado: HoneyComb.cmd abre el build de editor/dist sin dev server.
Primer arranque: si la carpeta del editor por defecto no existe, se crea con
una COPIA de levels/, assets/, characters.json e items.json del repositorio.
El motor Release lo compila el editor la primera vez que se pide, copiando
compilador y vcpkg de una carpeta ya configurada (engine-modes.js).
El renderer carga los dialogos grandes en archivos aparte (@defer).
end note
@enduml
